---
title: "08 | EMVA1288.lean: spatial non-uniformity"
---
%% Focused view; repeated boundary nodes retain their original names.
flowchart TB
  Assemble["some Report<br/>params = characterized parameters<br/>spatial = measureSpatialNonUniformity result<br/>Spatial failure still permits a report"]
  SpatialStats["spatialStats img<br/>n = img.pixels.size<br/>Returns Float mean, Float sample variance"]
    MeasureSpatial["measureSpatialNonUniformity<br/>Four Image Float values plus SensorParams<br/>Returns Option NonUniformity"]
    PairGuard{"darkA has zero pixels<br/>or any of four pixel counts differ?"}
    NoSpatial["none: omit spatial section"]
    AverageDark["avgDarkArr_i = (darkA_i + darkB_i) / 2<br/>avgDark Image uses darkA width and height"]
    CorrectLight["correctedArr_i = (illumA_i + illumB_i) / 2 - avgDarkArr_i<br/>correctedIllum Image uses illumA width and height"]
    DSNU["spatialStats avgDark yields varDarkSpatial<br/>dsnuDN = sqrt (max 0 varDarkSpatial)<br/>dsnuE = dsnuDN / params.gainK"]
    Signal["spatialStats correctedIllum<br/>yields meanSignal, varSignalSpatial"]
    SignalGuard{"meanSignal less than<br/>or equal to zero?"}
    PRNU["stdSignalSpatial = sqrt (max 0 varSignalSpatial)<br/>prnuPercent = stdSignalSpatial / meanSignal * 100"]
    SomeSpatial["some NonUniformity<br/>dsnu_DN = dsnuDN; dsnu_e = dsnuE<br/>prnu_percent = prnuPercent"]
    MeasureSpatial --> PairGuard
    PairGuard -->|yes| NoSpatial
    PairGuard -->|no| AverageDark --> CorrectLight
    AverageDark --> DSNU
    CorrectLight --> Signal --> SignalGuard
    DSNU -->|calls| SpatialStats
    Signal -->|calls| SpatialStats
    SignalGuard -->|yes| NoSpatial
    SignalGuard -->|no| PRNU --> SomeSpatial
    DSNU -->|DSNU fields| SomeSpatial
    NoSpatial --> Assemble
    SomeSpatial --> Assemble
